some tests. if you like.

353
00:22:34.799 --> 00:22:37.844
That's generous of you. Thank you.

354
00:22:39.387 --> 00:22:44.225
W... wait. Y... you know.
we have ransom insurance.

355
00:22:44.267 --> 00:22:50.064
